Naming note: web type `RangeProjection` and the existing dashboard-widget enum
`ProjectedRangeFormat` already exist in the app module; this page's structs were named
`ProjectedRangeSnapshot` and `ProjectedRangePageFormat` to avoid module redeclarations.

Architecture: SwiftUI View + @Observable model driven by a KMP-core-ready data-source
seam (ADR-004 — zero networking in the view body). The model holds SI only (metres, m/s,
Celsius, watt-hours, Wh/m); the user's unit preference is applied ONLY at the render
boundary through the shared `Units` facade + `useUnits` env (ADR-005). Glass surfaces use
native materials; tokens from the P2 catalog; charts use the P3 Swift Charts wrappers
(TSRadialGauge / TSAreaChart) — never a WKWebView; every visible literal resolves from
`Localizable.xcstrings` (ADR-014); a11y labels/traits on panels + charts (ADR-015).

